 "Other education (ISIC 854) covers education not classified elsewhere. This actor focuses
  on adult continuing-education and vocational-skills courses (driving schools, language
  schools, exam-prep, trade skill courses) with administrative coordination only. Implemented
  as Wave 4 actor following patterns in ADR-2607153700 (ISIC 852) and ADR-2607072915 (ISIC 851)."
